/// The power that holds a momentum against laminar friction: P = 2 pi mu L H^2/(rho^2 A^2 S^2).
/// - h: real[N m s] (passed in m^2 kg/s)
/// - mu: real[Pa s] (passed in kg/(m s))
/// - l: real[m] (passed in m)
/// - rho: real[kg/m^3] (passed in kg/m^3)
/// - d: real[mm] (passed in m)
/// - s: real[m^2] (passed in m^2)
